  question: Psalm 139 teaches that God is present in __________
  answers:
  - Heaven to hell and everywhere in between
  - Churches only
  - Louisiana only
  - Beaches only
  correctAnswerIndex: 0
  discussionAnswer: God is eternally present in all of His creation, including heaven
    and hell.  He is the joy of heaven and the dread of hell.
